#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to "
"new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. "
"It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit"
" code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can "
"help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions"
" based on [IBM Granite and other open-source "
"models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest "
"features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les LLMs de Qiskit Code Assistant ont pour but de rendre l'informatique "
"quantique plus accessible aux nouveaux utilisateurs de Qiskit et d'améliorer"
" l'expérience de codage des utilisateurs actuels. Il est entraîné à partir "
"de millions de tokens de texte issus du SDK Qiskit, d'années d'exemples de "
"code Qiskit, et des fonctionnalités d'IBM Quantum&reg;. Qiskit Code "
"Assistant peut améliorer ton flux de développement quantique en proposant "
"des suggestions générées par LLM basées sur les [modèles IBM Granite et "
"d'autres modèles open source](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), qui intègrent "
"les dernières fonctionnalités d'IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Remarques\">\n"
"- **Tu veux aller directement aux instructions d'installation ? Va à la section [Installer Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Si tu as des retours ou souhaites contacter l'équipe de développement, utilise le [canal Qiskit Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) ou les dépôts GitHub publics associés.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr ""
"Le Grand Modèle de Langage (LLM) derrière Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language "
"Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the "
"model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the"
" `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities "
"for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality "
"Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about "
"the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI "
"documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more "
"details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training "
"LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour fournir des suggestions de code, Qiskit Code Assistant utilise un Grand"
" Modèle de Langage (LLM). Dans ce cas, Qiskit Code Assistant s'appuie "
"actuellement sur le modèle `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, construit sur le "
"[modèle Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). Le modèle `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` améliore les"
" capacités de génération de code Qiskit du modèle `Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` grâce à un pré-entraînement étendu et à un "
"affinage sur des données Qiskit de haute qualité, ainsi que sur des commits "
"Python et des conversations. Pour plus d'informations sur la famille de "
"modèles Mistral AI, consulte la [documentation Mistral "
"AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). Pour plus de détails "
"sur les modèles `.*-qiskit`, voir [Qiskit Code Assistant : Training LLMs for"
" generating Quantum Computing Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. "
"Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nos LLMs spécialisés pour Qiskit sont également disponibles en tant que "
"modèles open source. Consulte tous les modèles disponibles sur "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr ""
"Les benchmarks Qiskit HumanEval et Qiskit HumanEval Hard {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated"
" with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks "
"called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran "
"them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple "
"challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit "
"libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour tester le modèle `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` et d'autres modèles, "
"nous avons collaboré avec des Qiskit Advocates et des experts pour créer les"
" benchmarks basés sur l'exécution appelés Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) et Qiskit "
"HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), et les avons appliqués aux modèles. Ces "
"benchmarks sont similaires à [HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), "
"et comprennent plusieurs problèmes de code complexes à résoudre, tous basés "
"sur les bibliothèques officielles de Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a"
" function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the "
"model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical"
" solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the "
"generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, "
"intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a "
"variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to "
"code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class "
"imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, "
"according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les benchmarks sont composés d'environ 150 tests, chacun constitué d'une "
"définition de fonction suivie d'une docstring qui détaille la tâche que le "
"modèle doit résoudre. Chaque exemple inclut également une solution canonique"
" de référence, ainsi que des tests unitaires, pour évaluer la correction des"
" solutions générées. Il existe trois niveaux de difficulté pour les tests : "
"basique, intermédiaire et difficile. Le benchmark Qiskit HumanEval Hard est "
"une variante du Qiskit HumanEval, mais supprime les informations relatives "
"aux imports de code, de sorte que le LLM doit déterminer les bons imports de"
" méthodes ou de classes. Ce changement rend l'ensemble de données bien plus "
"difficile pour les LLMs, selon nos tests et nos résultats initiaux.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at"
" these websites: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr ""
"Les jeux de données Qiskit HumanEval et Qiskit HumanEval Hard sont "
"disponibles sur ces sites : [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) et "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). Tu"
" peux contribuer au développement de ces benchmarks sur le [dépôt "
"GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Installer Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apprends à installer, configurer et utiliser n'importe quel modèle Qiskit "
"Code Assistant sur ta machine locale.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Télécharger depuis le site Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"Suis ces étapes pour télécharger n'importe quel modèle lié à Qiskit Code "
"Assistant depuis le site Hugging Face :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Navigue vers la page du modèle Qiskit souhaité sur Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Va dans l'onglet **Files and Versions** et télécharge les fichiers du modèle"
" au format safetensors ou GGUF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Télécharger avec la CLI Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour télécharger n'importe quel modèle Qiskit Code Assistant disponible à "
"l'aide de la CLI Hugging Face, suis ces étapes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"Installe la [CLI Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Connecte-toi à ton compte Hugging Face\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "Télécharge le modèle de ton choix depuis la liste précédente\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Déployer manuellement les modèles Qiskit Code "
"Assistant en local via Ollama\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Il existe plusieurs façons de déployer et d'interagir avec le modèle Qiskit "
"Code Assistant téléchargé. Ce guide montre comment utiliser "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) comme suit : soit avec l'[application "
"Ollama](#using-the-ollama-application) via l'intégration Hugging Face Hub ou"
" un modèle local, soit avec le [package `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-"
"python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Utiliser l'application Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'application Ollama offre une solution simple pour exécuter les LLMs "
"localement. Elle est facile à utiliser, avec une CLI qui rend l'ensemble du "
"processus de configuration, la gestion des modèles et l'interaction assez "
"simples. Elle est idéale pour une expérimentation rapide et pour les "
"utilisateurs qui souhaitent gérer moins de détails techniques.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Installer Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Télécharge l'[application Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Installe le fichier téléchargé\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Lance l'application Ollama installée\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        L'application fonctionne correctement lorsque l'icône Ollama apparaît dans la barre de menu du bureau. Tu peux également vérifier que le service est en cours d'exécution en accédant à `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Essaie Ollama dans ton terminal et commence à exécuter des modèles. Par "
"exemple :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Configurer Ollama avec l'intégration Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'[intégration Ollama/Hugging Face "
"Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) permet d'interagir avec les "
"modèles hébergés sur le Hugging Face Hub sans avoir à créer un nouveau "
"modelfile ni à télécharger manuellement les fichiers GGUF ou safetensors. "
"Les fichiers `template` et `params` par défaut sont déjà inclus pour le "
"modèle sur le Hugging Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Assure-toi que l'application Ollama est en cours d'exécution.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Va sur la page du modèle souhaité et copie l'URL. Par exemple, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Depuis ton terminal, exécute la commande :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser le modèle `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` ou "
"n'importe lequel des autres modèles GGUF officiels recommandés "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` ou "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Configurer Ollama avec un modèle GGUF Qiskit Code Assistant téléchargé "
"manuellement {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-"
"assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tu as téléchargé manuellement un modèle GGUF comme "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF et que tu "
"souhaites expérimenter avec différents templates et paramètres, tu peux "
"suivre ces étapes pour le charger dans ton application Ollama locale.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crée un `Modelfile` avec le contenu suivant et assure-toi de mettre à jour "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` avec le chemin réel de ton modèle téléchargé.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Exécute la commande suivante pour créer une instance de modèle personnalisée"
" basée sur le `Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Ce processus peut prendre un certain temps pour qu'Ollama lise le fichier du modèle, initialise l'instance du modèle et la configure selon les spécifications fournies.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr ""
"Exécuter le modèle Qiskit Code Assistant téléchargé manuellement dans Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"Une fois le modèle `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` configuré dans Ollama, exécute"
" la commande suivante pour lancer le modèle et interagir avec lui dans le "
"terminal (en mode chat).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        “max_tokens”: 512,\n"
"        “echo”: False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        “top_k”: 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
